{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/KeyArt.png?t=1748968238\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take command of a colossal floating fortress in Skyfire: Death from Above, a real-time strategy and bullet heaven hybrid set in an alternate history where humanity has risen to the skies to survive an endless war. Navigate a world torn apart by aerial battles, plunder vital resources, and build your citadel to withstand relentless waves of enemies. Combine tactical combat, resource management, and modular upgrades for a dynamic and engaging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/Banner1.png?t=1748968238\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/GIF_Steam_Upgrades.gif?t=1748968238\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and manage resources to build and customize your floating fortress, adapting defensive and offensive modules to face growing threats. Design the ultimate citadel, capable of withstanding any siege and dominating the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/Banner2.png?t=1748968238\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587470/extras/GIF_Steam_Exploring.gif?t=1748968238\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture into a war-torn world, where the skies are the new battlefield. Discover valuable resources, face unique challenges, and unravel the secrets of a world in constant conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=